{"video":"jH-hg8FwOPE","lines":[{"t":[0,3],"en":"Hello Ron. It's Ron."},{"t":[3,7],"en":"I'm a bit fearful that we're verging on what I call feelings territory."},{"t":[7,8],"en":"Feel."},{"t":[9,10],"en":"This is my hell."},{"t":[10,12],"en":"What the hell? No!"},{"t":[18,19],"en":"Ron, no, no, no, no!"},{"t":[21,22],"en":"Ron, stop it!"},{"t":[28,31],"en":"I'm just gonna stay angry. I find that relaxes me."},{"t":[33,35],"en":"I don't wanna seem overdramatic,"},{"t":[35,37],"en":"but I don't really care what happens here."},{"t":[37,38],"en":"What are the shrimp?"},{"t":[38,39],"en":"Ah."},{"t":[40,41],"en":"Okay."},{"t":[46,47],"en":"Ron, are you mad at me?"},{"t":[47,49],"en":"'Cause without eyebrows, I can't really tell."},{"t":[56,60],"en":"What say we just stand here in silence?"},{"t":[67,69],"en":"Ah, there I go, getting all sappy."},{"t":[77,78],"en":"She's here, isn't she?"},{"t":[80,81],"en":"Oh!"},{"t":[81,82],"en":"Ron!"},{"t":[84,86],"en":"I love Bonnie!"},{"t":[86,87],"en":"I love nothing!"},{"t":[87,89],"en":"I'm not interested in caring about people."},{"t":[101,102],"en":"Stop this."},{"t":[106,107],"en":"I'm quite lonely."},{"t":[109,110],"en":"Ron?"},{"t":[111,112],"en":"Ask me if I'm sad."},{"t":[113,114],"en":"No."},{"t":[115,116],"en":"Boom."},{"t":[116,117],"en":"Sadness."},{"t":[120,121],"en":"I'm ending this right now."},{"t":[121,123],"en":"I'm just gonna leave early and go home."},{"t":[130,131],"en":"Motion sensors."}]}
